---
layout: v2/base.njk
locale: "en"
permalink: "en/contact.html"
title: "Contact us — AZERTY Global"
description: "A question, a suggestion, a bug, a press enquiry: one form, and every message is read. Discord, email and GitHub issues if another channel suits you better."
canonicalPath: "/en/contact"
frPath: "/contact"
ogType: "website"
ogDescription: "A question, a suggestion, a bug, a press enquiry: one form, and every message is read."
bodyClass: "page-contact"
robots: "index, follow"
extraStyles:
  - "/css/v2/contact.css"
scripts:
  - "/js/v2/formulaire.js"
  - "/js/v2/contact.js"
# ⛔ No FAQPage block here or on any refonte page (decision D42, 2026-09-14).
jsonLd:
  - |-
    {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
        "itemListElement": [{
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 1,
          "name": "Home",
          "item": "https://azerty.global/en/"
        },{
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 2,
          "name": "Contact us",
          "item": "https://azerty.global/en/contact"
        }]
      }
  - |-
    {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "ContactPage",
        "name": "Contact us — AZERTY Global",
        "description": "AZERTY Global contact form: feedback, suggestion, question, bug report, press enquiry.",
        "url": "https://azerty.global/en/contact",
        "inLanguage": "en",
        "isPartOf": {
          "@type": "WebSite",
          "name": "AZERTY Global",
          "url": "https://azerty.global"
        }
      }
---

  <section class="hero-contact">
    <div class="conteneur">
      <h1>Contact us</h1>
      <p class="hero-contact__definition">
        A missing character, an application that resists, a question, an idea&nbsp;: say it here.
        The form adapts to what you have to say, and every message is read.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Store reminder — revealed by js/v2/contact.js on Windows only, the one
       system where the application exists. Secondary button: the page's single
       primary action is sending the form. -->
  <section class="section" id="rappel-store" hidden>
    <div class="conteneur">
      <div class="mesure-lecture carte rappel-store">
        <div>
          <h2 class="rappel-store__titre">Using the Windows application&nbsp;?</h2>
          <p class="texte-2 rappel-store__texte">
            A review on the Microsoft Store takes thirty seconds and does far more for the project’s
            visibility than a private message. The two add up&nbsp;: rate it, then tell us here what
            deserves to be fixed.
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="rappel-store__actions">
          <a class="bouton bouton--secondaire" href="ms-windows-store://review/?ProductId=9N4BTS43SSSZ" data-analytics-event="store_review_contact">Rate the app on the Store</a>
          <a href="https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9n4bts43sssz?hl=en-GB&amp;gl=GB&amp;cid=website_contact" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">or open the Store listing</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="conteneur">
     <div class="mesure-lecture">

      <p class="texte-petit texte-2 formulaire__convention">
        Every field is required, except those marked «&nbsp;optional&nbsp;».
      </p>

      <!-- `action` and `access_key` live in the HTML: without JavaScript the
           browser validates natively and the message is still sent. It is
           js/v2/formulaire.js that sets `novalidate` and intercepts the send.
           Without JS no conditional group is hidden: the form is longer, never
           broken. -->
      <form id="formulaire-contact"
            class="formulaire"
            method="POST"
            action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit"
            data-formulaire
            data-fin="contact-confirmation"
            data-echec="contact-echec">

        <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="a4d82407-9cc8-4242-b491-ebd1e736a4fc">
        <input type="hidden" name="subject" id="contact-sujet" value="New message — AZERTY Global">
        <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="AZERTY Global Contact">
        <input type="hidden" name="form_type" value="contact">
        <input type="hidden" name="source" id="contact-source" value="contact-page-en">
        <input type="hidden" name="date" value="">

        <!-- Anti-robot decoy: a box ticked by a script is a box nobody saw.
             `display: none` does not remove the field from the FormData. -->
        <div class="formulaire__leurre" aria-hidden="true">
          <label for="botcheck">Leave this empty</label>
          <input type="checkbox" id="botcheck" name="botcheck" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
        </div>

        <div class="message message--erreur formulaire__bilan" hidden tabindex="-1">
          <strong class="message__titre"></strong>
          <ol></ol>
        </div>

        <fieldset class="formulaire__groupe">
          <legend class="formulaire__legende">Your message</legend>

          <div class="champ">
            <label class="champ__intitule" for="motif">What is it about&nbsp;?</label>
            <select class="saisie saisie--liste" id="motif" name="motif" required>
              <option value="">Choose…</option>
              <option value="positif">Positive feedback</option>
              <option value="suggestion">A suggestion</option>
              <option value="question">A question</option>
              <option value="bug-installation">A bug&nbsp;: installing or uninstalling</option>
              <option value="bug-caracteres">A bug&nbsp;: wrong characters</option>
              <option value="bug-raccourcis">A bug&nbsp;: keyboard shortcuts</option>
              <option value="bug-application">A bug&nbsp;: problem with an application</option>
              <option value="presse">Press or partnership</option>
            </select>
            <span class="champ__erreur" id="motif-erreur" hidden></span>
          </div>

          <div class="champ">
            <label class="champ__intitule" for="description">Your message</label>
            <textarea class="saisie saisie--zone" id="description" name="description" rows="6"
                      aria-describedby="description-aide"
                      placeholder="What happened, what you expected, and in which application." required></textarea>
            <p class="champ__aide" id="description-aide">
              For a bug, the steps that reproduce it are worth all the rest&nbsp;: they are what
              allows a fix without writing back to you.
            </p>
            <span class="champ__erreur" id="description-erreur" hidden></span>
          </div>

          <!-- Revealed by js/v2/contact.js for the « presse » motive. -->
          <div class="champ" id="champ-organisation" data-motifs="presse" hidden>
            <label class="champ__intitule" for="organisation">Your outlet or organisation</label>
            <input class="saisie" type="text" id="organisation" name="organisation"
                   placeholder="The name of the publication, company or school.">
            <span class="champ__erreur" id="organisation-erreur" hidden></span>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <!-- ——— Conditional group: the bug in detail ———
             Revealed by js/v2/contact.js on the four « bug-* » motives. The
             script sets `hidden` on the fieldset AND on each `.champ`:
             js/v2/formulaire.js only skips hidden `.champ` blocks. -->
        <fieldset class="formulaire__groupe" id="groupe-bug" data-motifs="bug" hidden>
          <legend class="formulaire__legende">The bug in detail</legend>

          <div class="champ">
            <label class="champ__intitule" for="nom-application">
              Application concerned <span class="champ__facultatif">(optional)</span>
            </label>
            <input class="saisie" type="text" id="nom-application" name="nom-application"
                   placeholder="Word, VS Code, Chrome, Discord…">
            <span class="champ__erreur" id="nom-application-erreur" hidden></span>
          </div>

          <div class="champ">
            <label class="champ__intitule" for="version-application">
              Application version <span class="champ__facultatif">(optional)</span>
            </label>
            <input class="saisie" type="text" id="version-application" name="version-application"
                   placeholder="1.1.0, shown under « About ».">
            <span class="champ__erreur" id="version-application-erreur" hidden></span>
          </div>

          <div class="champ">
            <label class="champ__intitule" for="etapes-reproduction">
              Steps to reproduce it <span class="champ__facultatif">(optional)</span>
            </label>
            <textarea class="saisie saisie--zone" id="etapes-reproduction" name="etapes-reproduction" rows="4"
                      placeholder="1. Turn Caps Lock on&#10;2. Press the &amp; key&#10;3. …"></textarea>
            <span class="champ__erreur" id="etapes-reproduction-erreur" hidden></span>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <!-- ——— Conditional group: your setup ——— -->
        <fieldset class="formulaire__groupe" id="groupe-configuration" data-motifs="bug" hidden>
          <legend class="formulaire__legende">Your setup</legend>
          <p class="champ__aide">
            The same symptom does not have the same cause depending on the system and the install
            channel. These answers save a round trip.
          </p>

          <div class="formulaire__rangee">
            <div class="champ">
              <label class="champ__intitule" for="systeme-exploitation">Operating system</label>
              <select class="saisie saisie--liste" id="systeme-exploitation" name="systeme-exploitation" required>
                <option value="">Choose…</option>
                <option value="win11">Windows 11</option>
                <option value="win10">Windows 10</option>
                <option value="win-other">Windows (another version)</option>
                <option value="mac">macOS</option>
                <option value="linux">Linux</option>
              </select>
              <span class="champ__erreur" id="systeme-exploitation-erreur" hidden></span>
            </div>

            <div class="champ">
              <label class="champ__intitule" for="type-clavier">Keyboard type</label>
              <select class="saisie saisie--liste" id="type-clavier" name="type-clavier" required>
                <option value="">Choose…</option>
                <option value="iso">ISO (standard European keyboard)</option>
                <option value="ansi">ANSI (US keyboard)</option>
                <option value="ergonomique">Ergonomic or split</option>
                <option value="autre">Other</option>
              </select>
              <span class="champ__erreur" id="type-clavier-erreur" hidden></span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Doubly conditional: this field only opens if the group is open
               AND the chosen system is Windows. -->
          <div class="champ" id="champ-installation" hidden>
            <label class="champ__intitule" for="methode-installation">Installed version</label>
            <select class="saisie saisie--liste" id="methode-installation" name="methode-installation">
              <option value="">Choose…</option>
              <option value="microsoft-store">Application (Microsoft Store)</option>
              <option value="msix">Signed MSIX, outside the Store</option>
              <option value="installeur">Classic installer (keyboard driver)</option>
              <option value="inconnu">I don’t know</option>
            </select>
            <span class="champ__erreur" id="methode-installation-erreur" hidden></span>
          </div>

          <div class="champ">
            <label class="champ__intitule" for="methode-frappe">Typing method</label>
            <select class="saisie saisie--liste" id="methode-frappe" name="methode-frappe" required>
              <option value="">Choose…</option>
              <option value="dactylographie">Touch typing</option>
              <option value="semi-aveugle">Semi-touch, occasional glance</option>
              <option value="regard-clavier">Looking at the keyboard regularly</option>
            </select>
            <span class="champ__erreur" id="methode-frappe-erreur" hidden></span>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <!-- ——— Conditional group: your rating ———
             Hidden on « presse » only: rating the layout from 1 to 10 makes no
             sense in an interview request. -->
        <fieldset class="formulaire__groupe" id="groupe-note" data-motifs-exclus="presse">
          <legend class="formulaire__legende">Your rating</legend>

          <div class="champ">
            <span class="champ__intitule" id="note-intitule">Overall rating, from 1 to 10</span>
            <div class="echelle" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="note-intitule" aria-describedby="note-erreur">
              <input type="radio" id="note-1" name="note" value="1" required>
              <label class="echelle__cran" for="note-1">1</label>
              <input type="radio" id="note-2" name="note" value="2">
              <label class="echelle__cran" for="note-2">2</label>
              <input type="radio" id="note-3" name="note" value="3">
              <label class="echelle__cran" for="note-3">3</label>
              <input type="radio" id="note-4" name="note" value="4">
              <label class="echelle__cran" for="note-4">4</label>
              <input type="radio" id="note-5" name="note" value="5">
              <label class="echelle__cran" for="note-5">5</label>
              <input type="radio" id="note-6" name="note" value="6">
              <label class="echelle__cran" for="note-6">6</label>
              <input type="radio" id="note-7" name="note" value="7">
              <label class="echelle__cran" for="note-7">7</label>
              <input type="radio" id="note-8" name="note" value="8">
              <label class="echelle__cran" for="note-8">8</label>
              <input type="radio" id="note-9" name="note" value="9">
              <label class="echelle__cran" for="note-9">9</label>
              <input type="radio" id="note-10" name="note" value="10">
              <label class="echelle__cran" for="note-10">10</label>
            </div>
            <p class="echelle__bornes">
              <span>1 · Very unsatisfied</span>
              <span>10 · Perfect</span>
            </p>
            <span class="champ__erreur" id="note-erreur" hidden></span>
          </div>

          <div class="champ">
            <label class="champ__intitule" for="note-raison">
              What motivates this rating <span class="champ__facultatif">(optional)</span>
            </label>
            <textarea class="saisie saisie--zone" id="note-raison" name="note-raison" rows="3"
                      placeholder="One sentence is enough."></textarea>
            <span class="champ__erreur" id="note-raison-erreur" hidden></span>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="formulaire__groupe">
          <legend class="formulaire__legende">So we can reply</legend>

          <div class="champ">
            <label class="champ__intitule" for="email">
              Your email <span class="champ__facultatif">(optional)</span>
            </label>
            <input class="saisie" type="email" id="email" name="email"
                   autocomplete="email" aria-describedby="email-aide"
                   placeholder="you@example.com">
            <p class="champ__aide" id="email-aide">
              Only to reply to you. The address is neither published, nor passed on, nor used to
              write to you about anything else.
            </p>
            <span class="champ__erreur" id="email-erreur" hidden></span>
          </div>

          <div class="champ champ--case">
            <input class="saisie--case" type="checkbox" id="promotion" name="promotion">
            <label class="champ__intitule" for="promotion">
              I allow AZERTY Global to quote this feedback on the site to present the project.
            </label>
            <span class="champ__erreur" id="promotion-erreur" hidden></span>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="formulaire__envoi">
          <button type="submit" class="bouton bouton--primaire">Send</button>
          <p class="texte-petit texte-2 formulaire__mention">
            The message is sent through Web3Forms to the project’s mailbox. No account, no tracker,
            no data kept on this site.
          </p>
        </div>
      </form>

      <!-- Revealed by js/v2/formulaire.js after a successful send; the form is
           hidden at the same moment so as not to invite a duplicate. -->
      <div class="formulaire__fin" id="contact-confirmation" hidden tabindex="-1">
        <div class="message message--succes">
          <strong class="message__titre">Your message has been sent</strong>
          <p>
            Thank you&nbsp;: it will be read. If it calls for an answer and you left an address, it
            will come from <code>contact@azerty.global</code>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="etapes-suivantes">
          <a href="/en/guide" class="etape-suivante">
            <strong>Getting started guide</strong>
            <p>The five changes, in plain words</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/faq" class="etape-suivante">
            <strong>Help and FAQ</strong>
            <p>Special characters and troubleshooting</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/support" class="etape-suivante">
            <strong>Support the project</strong>
            <p>Contribute in your own way</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Revealed by js/v2/formulaire.js if the request fails. The fallback
           channel is named here, not in the script: it is content, not a cog. -->
      <div class="message message--erreur" id="contact-echec" hidden tabindex="-1">
        <strong class="message__titre">The message could not be sent</strong>
        <p>
          Your message has not left and is still in the form. Try again in a moment&nbsp;; if the
          error comes back, write directly to
          <!--email_off--><a href="mailto:contact@azerty.global">contact@azerty.global</a><!--/email_off-->
          or go through
          <a href="https://discord.gg/nYknqshJz3" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discord</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
     </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="conteneur">
      <div class="mesure-lecture">
        <h2>Would another channel suit you better&nbsp;?</h2>
        <dl class="canaux">
          <dt class="canaux__nom">
            <a href="https://discord.gg/nYknqshJz3" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discord</a>
          </dt>
          <dd class="canaux__quoi">To talk with people already using the layout, and get a quick answer.</dd>

          <dt class="canaux__nom">
            <!--email_off--><a href="mailto:contact@azerty.global">contact@azerty.global</a><!--/email_off-->
          </dt>
          <dd class="canaux__quoi">For press, associations and anything that needs a written trace.</dd>

          <dt class="canaux__nom">
            <a href="https://github.com/AMCF-asso/azerty-global-website/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub issues</a>
          </dt>
          <dd class="canaux__quoi">For a technical bug you can describe, with public tracking.</dd>

          <dt class="canaux__nom">
            <a href="https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9n4bts43sssz?hl=en-GB&amp;gl=GB&amp;cid=website_contact" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Microsoft Store listing</a>
          </dt>
          <dd class="canaux__quoi">To leave a public review of the Windows application.</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
